,"kind":"announcement","title":"Ski Lines joins Steam Next Fest! ⛷️","summary":"We're joining Steam Next Fest! 🎉Hello everyone!Big news! Ski Lines is taking part in Steam Next Fest, October 19–26!If you've ever dreamed of designing your own ski resort, now's your chance! Build pistes, connect ski lifts, manage your mountain, and try to keep your skiers happy as your resort grows.The free demo is available to play, and we've prepared a fresh patch to make your time on the slopes even better!Patch 0.2.1 — Smoother slopes ahead!This update focuses on a few improvements inspire","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T22:04:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688153","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4854120-1844751498233998","game_id":"steam-4854120","kind":"announcement","title":"The Mountain Comes Alive","summary":"This update adds a whole bunch of new scenery elements to Ski Lines.Rocks, barriers, cliffs, chalets, rivers and plenty of other obstacles can now be found across the different maps.But they are not just here to look pretty.They will also make planning your resort a little trickier. You'll need to work around obstacles, find better routes and sometimes rethink an entire piste or lift.In short: a little more challenge, and much more picturesque mountains.🚡 Surface lifts now stay on the surfaceWe'","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T11:56:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233998","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4854120-1844115010501620","game_id":"steam-4854120","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.1.1","summary":"Patch 0.1.1 is here!This update focuses on a few things that quickly came up while watching people play the demo: making trail removal much less frustrating, giving you a little more freedom at the start of a game… and planting a lot more trees.✏️ Better trail removalThe trail removal tool has been completely reworked.Previously, right-clicking a trail could remove an entire section, sometimes considerably more than you intended.Now, trails are erased meter by meter, giving you much more precise","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T14:54:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501620","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4854120-1842846814446139","game_id":"steam-4854120","kind":"announcement","title":"The Ski Lines Demo Is Out Now! 🎿","summary":"It’s finally time.The Ski Lines demo is now available on Steam!You can now jump in, draw your first pistes, build ski lifts and attempt to keep an increasingly questionable mountain transport network under control.🏔️ Build your ski resortIn Ski Lines, you design your own ski area directly on the mountain.Connect stations, summits and points of interest with pistes, build and upgrade ski lifts, and keep an eye on how skiers move through your network.It starts simple.Then one piste gets overcrowde","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T11:20:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446139","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4854120-1842846814442830","game_id":"steam-4854120","kind":"announcement","title":"Controller, Sunlight, Freedom","summary":"🎮 Ski Lines now supports controllers We finally added full controller support.At first, we were pretty sceptical.Ski Lines is all about moving around a large map, selecting things precisely and, most importantly, drawing pistes. On paper, it felt like the kind of game that would always be more comfortable with a mouse.Turns out that’s not really the case.To our surprise, the controller feels extremely good to use.Navigation feels natural, the shortcuts quickly become second nature, and drawing p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T10:03:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814442830","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4854120-1840944183776461","game_id":"steam-4854120","kind":"announcement","title":"Ski Lines is now on Steam! 🎿","summary":"In Ski Lines, you design and manage a ski resort directly on a piste map.Draw ski runs, build lifts, connect mountain landmarks, and adapt your network as more and more skiers arrive.Every new connection changes the flow of your resort — and a perfectly organized mountain can quickly turn into complete chaos.What you can expect🚠 Build ski lifts and connect the mountain🎿 Draw green, blue, red and black pistes🏔️ Explore ski resorts inspired by destinations around the world🗺️ Create and share custo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T11:20:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776461","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4854120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:42Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:41Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4854120":"2026-10-26T04:46:42Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4854120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:41Z","status":"ok","err